WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.020
Thanks to the stupid hero,
we're in the middle

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.090
of a battle to rescue our Princess.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.820
The battle at the fortress is becoming

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.160
chaotic with General Godwin, Countess Dalkian,

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.780
Yuki, and Rico all getting involved.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.740
I have my hands full dealing with Genoise!

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.030
Hero! Hurry up and save the Princess!

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.120
Fierce Battle at Fortress Mion!

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.640
I'm taking the Princess back!

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.310
Try if you can!

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.340
Take... this!

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:17.900
Noir!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:20.200
Okay!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:28.710
Vert!

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.500
Yes!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.150
Prince Gaul's... Genoise...

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:03.370
Basically, those three are dumb airheads, but...

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.490
When it comes to fighting...
they're pretty good...

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.130
Hey!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.060
Not bad...

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.710
Good enough to have an audience...

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:33.100
But I'd like to see you do something more flashy.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:37.070
Our battles need to be a performance, after all.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.760
Strength, brilliance, and dynamism!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.950
These are essential to all knights and warriors!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.360
And the power you need is

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.910
this shining power!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.420
Release shining power...

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.250
Shishioh Soga!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.730
Tenrai!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.370
Blast maneuver!

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:31.370
Huh?!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.560
What do you think?

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:46.140
A Tenrai blast maneuver from the Shishioh Soga!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.350
It's my shining power special weapon
that everyone's talking about!

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.350
You're finished!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.400
Does it look like I'm finished?!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.900
Huh? Well, I was sure you were finished!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.870
Why are you still standing?

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.360
Are you a monster?
 You must be!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:20.030
Man, he must have taken
a defensive move in that instant!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:23.710
Huh?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.180
It worked after all!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.680
Hey, stupid!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.100
You're injured!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.840
People from other worlds can't turn into fur balls,

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.350
so you shouldn't be so reckless!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.730
Uh, no need for you to worry!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.230
I think I'm getting the picture now...

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.950
Shining power is something like this?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.630
She cannot make it to the concert in time!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.650
Everyone is waiting to hear the Princess sing!

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.550
Huh? Concert?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.880
Here I come!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.470
Wait, wait a minute? What concert?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.740
Oyakata-sama!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.580
We're in trouble!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.830
Enemy reinforcement is approaching!!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.080
How many?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.530
Um, the thing is...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.960
...it's only one!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:52.470
Princess Leo is riding up alone!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.500
Open the main gate!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.440
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:04.650
Your highness!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.400
Well, Princess Leo, it's been a while.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.300
Long time no see, Countess Dalkian,

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.460
but I'm the lord now,
 so don't call me Princess.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.290
My apologies!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.250
Your highness...

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.790
This is ummm...

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.740
Get out of the way, Dalkian!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.890
I'm extremely sorry, but this is a battlefield...

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:38.180
...and I am currently backing the young warriors.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.100
Are you telling me I must defeat you?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.190
Yes.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.110
Don't underestimate me!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:52.450
My skills now match yours!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.450
I shall be your opponent.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.550
It looks like the battle at the fortress is still going on...

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:17.260
Oh my, then the princess might not get here in time.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.640
What?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.810
We can't hear the Princess sing?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.050
Well, the knights and our Hero are

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.770
fighting hard right now...

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.540
So let's wait and see...

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.820
Yes, mom!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.650
Leo-sama, I hear you have been

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:45.820
So what?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.590
It's the battle business of
the Galette Kingdom, nothing unusual!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.810
Our earnest leader of the knights is troubled by

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.510
the invasions you have ordered...

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.620
Since we cannot have the concerts of the

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.390
Princess and regular events as planned...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.850
So what!

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.680
I mean, your dog princess, she holds

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:09.330
events like the potato-digging battles...

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.020
...and battles in the water that just look like

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.420
everyone's bathing in the sea...

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.550
How can that appease the hot-blooded youth?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.950
It looks like everyone is enjoying them...

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.950
I'm not saying they aren't fun!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:29.380
I'm just saying they're not enough!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.290
Well, I'm sure our Princess is still

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:34.010
lacking in some points, but...

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.720
With age and experience,

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.840
So please give her some time...

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.290
Well, if only that were an option...

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:52.480
Princess Leo?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.880
Enough talk!

00:09:56.270 --> 00:10:00.570
I will do what I want no matter what anyone says!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.470
That was brilliant. I surrender.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.650
Come, Godwin!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.900
Yes!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.450
That was amazing, as always your highness!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.950
You got that knight with just one blow...

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.210
Idiot!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:43.830
Huh?

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.720
She only put in 20 percent of her true power...

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.830
That's...

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.130
And I only put in 30 percent...

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.860
No it was more like 25 percent!

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.090
Of course your highness!

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.700
Uh, so are you serious about this concert?

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:07.770
Really?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.980
That's what I've been trying to tell you!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.340
Those stupid... Genoise and the bunch...

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.980
Can't they ever get anything right?

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:18.190
What are you going on about...?

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.170
Gaul!

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:30.910
And the stupid hero of Biscotti!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.760
Sister!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:33.790
Stupid?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.380
You little brats!

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.800
How could you fool around in the battlefield!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.300
Oh! We're sorry!

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.820
Leo-sama, I'm terribly sorry...

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.900
I had no idea!

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.780
It's all those two idiot's fault!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.620
I'm coming in!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.150
Leo-sama, it's been a long...

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:14.120
I'm sorry, Princess Millefiore...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.960
I apologize for the disrespectful actions of my unworthy brother...

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.530
It is most tasteless to have interfered with

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:23.380
the celebrations of the victorious nation...

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:27.750
Oh, um, Prince Gaul was not aware...

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:28.840
I will think of a way

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.140
to apologize properly for this another day...

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.440
First you must promptly return...

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:37.480
Leo-sama...

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.590
Rouge, I'm leaving the rest to you!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:41.760
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.640
Uh, so we really can't get back in time?

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.290
The princess's appearance is scheduled
to start in twenty minutes...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.630
...but no matter how much we hurry

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.000
Oh nooo! How can that be!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.590
Really, don't worry about it, please...

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.000
Even if you say so...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.420
Hey, if we get up, they'll hit us again

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.220
Pretend we're unconscious...
pretend we're unconscious...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.220
Pretend...

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.910
I will get you there, Princess!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.910
Get her there?

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.290
How?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.790
Well, of course that's...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.380
With the Hero Super Express!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.320
Um, Prince?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.880
Um what was your name?

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:54.140
Hey don't forget it! It's Gaul!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.610
I figured it out from

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:57.350
watching Gaul use the shining power,

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.440
so I think I'll be alright.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.580
Here we go, Princess!

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.940
Yes, Hero-sama!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.070
One, two...

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.950
We're off!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.880
Hero-sama! That's amazing!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.200
You're able to handle the shining power and the seal?

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.580
Yeah, I think I figured some of it out!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.090
I'll learn more, too!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.430
Ho-hum, cat balls, is that so?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.250
Countess Dalkian!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.480
Brioche! Nice to see you again!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.400
Oh, Princess! And the Hero!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.480
I'm getting the Princess home!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.820
Here we go!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:53.950
Hey!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.250
Princess, it's a pleasure to see you!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.410
Yukikaze!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.000
Yes... Hero, it's an honor to meet you!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:05.040
I am Yukikaze Panettone,
leader of the Secret Unit

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.010
of the Knights of Biscotti.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.170
Nice to meet you! I saw you fighting!

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.510
Thank you!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.820
I am somewhat confident that I can run,

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:16.140
so I can take over for a while

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.020
and carry the princess if you like!

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.320
Thank you. But I'm alright.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.020
I just thought of a way to run faster!

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.090
The shining power that is emitted from the seal...

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.760
...it's form and strength are stronger

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:33.740
Yes!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.450
That's right!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.450
That means I can do this...

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.000
I did it!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.010
Wow! That's so cool!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.410
So then, Yukikaze-san...

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.090
Just call me Yukikaze.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.640
Then, Yukikaze, we'll go ahead now...

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.930
Go ahead?

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.350
Princess, hold on tight!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.230
Boost ride...!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:04.020
Go!!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.950
Princess, you can relax now!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.060
Um, Hero...

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:33.350
you shouldn't use your power so much...

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.730
If you use too much shining power,

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.810
I'm fine...

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.890
It's a lot easier than running!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.690
Um, Hero-sama...

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:52.740
Yes?

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.490
There was something I wanted to tell you...

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:56.550
Yes...

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:01.540
I just recently became the ruler of Biscotti.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.470
All the Knights have been knights when

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:07.540
my father was their leader...

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.300
I'm just a novice as a lord and I can't do anything right...

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:16.590
That's why I've caused you so much trouble, Hero...

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.380
Not at all!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.560
You haven't caused me any trouble!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.660
You summoned me, and in just one day,

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.150
And I got to meet such an adorable princess...

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.410
And what's wrong you being novice?

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.160
I'm also a novice hero with just one day's experience!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.000
Even baby chicks can fly if they try hard enough!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.350
If you try hard every day, you're sure

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:54.120
to become a wonderful adult someday!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.560
That's what my master taught me!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.140
We're landing!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.620
It'll be a rough landing, so hang on!

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.390
Yes, Hero!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.160
Sorry for the delay! I, Millefiore, have arrived!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.430
Ten minutes to show time!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:26.720
Makeup artists, stylists, get working!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:27.410
Yes, ma'am!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.460
I will lecture you later...

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.190
Do you remember what you're supposed to do?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.510
Yes, Amelita, I'll be fine!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.860
Now the moment you've all been waiting for...

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:03.490
In today's battle the Hero who came to Biscotti...

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:06.730
...and all the Knights who always work so hard

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.570
brought victory to our nation.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.040
I will use this victory...

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.630
to give everyone an even better tomorrow...

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.230
I will sing this song
to give everyone the courage to try harder...

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.720
The song is "I must be in love."

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:45.810
Always kind, strong and sincere...

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:53.250
I've been watching you from afar

00:19:53.610 --> 00:20:01.260
The scenery I dreamed of
is the sky we look up at together

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:08.830
Standing side by side and looking at each other

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:17.520
There is still some distance between us

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:25.200
But I hope we can walk together someday

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:33.540
A mild ripple sways my mind...

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:41.550
...every time I think of you... I must be in love

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.510
I'm relieved to hear she got back in time...

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:53.560
Yes...

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.480
Is the Hero alright?

00:20:58.070 --> 00:20:59.570
Yes... indeed.

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.820
I thought so...

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.210
We'll handle the clean up...

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.880
you guys head home.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:10.160
We need to celebrate two victories in row.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:10.830
Yes!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.550
It's a nice song.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:27.600
I love you and your kind eyes

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:35.270
I must be in love, I want to embrace you softly

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:40.190
I want to embrace you more...

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:53.580
I want to embrace you more...

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.220
Hey Princess!

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:32.770
Cute!

00:23:32.770 --> 00:23:33.580
Amazing!

00:23:33.580 --> 00:23:34.410
Best in the world!

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:35.650
Indeed!

00:23:35.290 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Star Reading Princess</b>

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:37.330
You're making me blush.
